{
  "id": "2CO.6",
  "number": "6",
  "bookId": "2CO",
  "reference": "2 Cor. 6",
  "copyright": "The Holy Bible, New International Version® NIV® Copyright © 1973, 1978, 1984, 2011 by Biblica, Inc.® Used by Permission of Biblica, Inc.® All rights reserved worldwide.",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As God's co-workers we urge you not to receive God's grace in vain.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For he says,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2CO 6:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"In the time of my favor I heard you,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and in the day of salvation I helped you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m",
        "vid": "2CO 6:2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I tell you, now is the time of God's favor, now is the day of salvation.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paul's Hardships",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We put no stumbling block in anyone's path, so that our ministry will not be discredited.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rather, as servants of God we commend ourselves in every way: in great endurance; in troubles, hardships and distresses;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in beatings, imprisonments and riots; in hard work, sleepless nights and hunger;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in purity, understanding, patience and kindness; in the Holy Spirit and in sincere love;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in truthful speech and in the power of God; with weapons of righteousness in the right hand and in the left;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "through glory and dishonor, bad report and good report; genuine, yet regarded as impostors;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "known, yet regarded as unknown; dying, and yet we live on; beaten, and yet not killed;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sorrowful, yet always rejoicing; poor, yet making many rich; having nothing, and yet possessing everything.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We have spoken freely to you, Corinthians, and opened wide our hearts to you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "We are not withholding our affection from you, but you are withholding yours from us.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As a fair exchange—I speak as to my children—open wide your hearts also.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Warning Against Idolatry",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not be yoked together with unbelievers. For what do righteousness and wickedness have in common? Or what fellowship can light have with darkness?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What harmony is there between Christ and Belial",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "? Or what does a believer have in common with an unbeliever?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What agreement is there between the temple of God and idols? For we are the temple of the living God. As God has said:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2CO 6:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"I will live with them",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and walk among them,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2CO 6:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and I will be their God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and they will be my people.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2CO 6:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Come out from them",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and be separate,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "says the Lord.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2CO 6:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Touch no unclean thing,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and I will receive you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "2CO 6:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"I will be a Father to you,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and you will be my sons and daughters,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "2CO 6:18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "says the Lord Almighty.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
